<title>IRAN: Twenty killed in Iranian road accident.</title>
<headline>Twenty killed in Iranian road accident.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty people died in Iran when a minibus they were riding in collided with a truck carrying a crane, a local newspaper said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Kayhan daily said 15 men, three women and one child died instantly in the accident on Saturday and another died later in hospital.</p>
<p>It said the accident occured near Mashhad, 924 km (580 miles) east of Tehran.</p>
